    Vesper                  Rauno Freiberg                      MIT
    Vitesse                 Anthony Fu                          MIT

The generated modules are not these palettes. Three colours in each are solved for contrast
rather than read, the surface ladder is re-spaced where it was too flat to see, and a verb colour
is rotated where two verbs arrived the same. A theme here is best described as "after gruvbox",
not "gruvbox".
